DESCRIPTION:incubator designed to support university students in developing their games from concept to launch. Over a three-month incubation period\, participants receive specialized mentorship and guidance. The program culminates in a showcase where projects are presented to industry experts and investors\, with a special reward: the top team from each city earns a seat in the Mvplab program.
